  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing for the Consultative Group to Assist the Poor Multi Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO FINANCE GRANTS TO MICRO FINANCE INSTITUTIONS THAT DELIVER CREDITAND/OR SAVINGS SERVICES TO THE VERY POOR ON A FINANCIALLY SUSTAINregion (to be done by MFC) and with CGAP approval, do 5 case studies on linkages.  Work will start in ECA and will be done in other parts of the world.</narrative>
  </description>
